# Agentic Dev Playbook

Follow this workflow:

```text
[ PLANNING ]
DOR -> SPEC -> PLAN
       |
       v
  APPROVAL CHECKPOINT
       |
       v
[ EXECUTION ]
TDD -> BUILD -> VERIFY -> EVIDENCE -> REVIEW/PR -> DONE
```

Rules:

- do not skip phases
- ask for explicit approval after planning and before implementation
- use test-first implementation
- validate before claiming completion
- capture evidence before review
- keep commits atomic and use conventional commits
- preserve agent-specific behavior when rules differ across environments

If project-local `AGENTS.md` exists, treat it as the primary readable workflow file for the repository.
